{"id":2285,"date":"2024-09-19T12:33:23","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:33:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2285"},"modified":"2025-10-02T15:10:24","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T15:10:24","slug":"cardboard-candle-boxes","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-candle-boxes\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Candle Boxes"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Protective and Presentable Candle Box Solutions<\/h2>\n<p>Custom cardboard candle boxes offer a clean and protective way to pack, present, and ship your candles. Whether you&#8217;re a small-batch candle maker or a high-volume brand, the right packaging matters. At <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/a><\/strong>, we create <strong>custom cardboard boxes for candles<\/strong> in any size, shape, and design.<\/p>\n<p>We specialize in <strong>wholesale cardboard candle boxes<\/strong> for both new startups and established candle businesses. Choose from whiteboard, Kraft, or printed cardboard candle packaging \u2014 all available with finishing options like Gloss, Matte, and Spot UV.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"338\">Build the Right First Impression with Cardboard Candle Packaging<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"386\"><strong data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"386\">Custom Printed Options with Fast Turnaround<\/strong><\/p>\n<p data-start=\"388\" data-end=\"699\">We understand how important packaging is in the candle industry. It\u2019s not just about scent or burn time \u2014 your box needs to represent the product inside. A good first impression can lead to repeat customers. That\u2019s why we offer reliable cardboard candle boxes designed for visual appeal and structural strength.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"789\">We use <strong data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"742\">high-grade cardboard materials<\/strong> that support both protection and design needs.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"1030\">\n<li data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"837\">\n<p data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"837\"><strong data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"835\">Full-color offset and digital printing<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"892\">\n<p data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"892\"><strong data-start=\"840\" data-end=\"890\">Low minimum order quantities starting from 100<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"893\" data-end=\"946\">\n<p data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"946\"><strong data-start=\"895\" data-end=\"944\">100% recyclable and eco-safe material options<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"997\">\n<p data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"997\"><strong data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"995\">Matte, Gloss, or Spot UV coating available<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1030\">\n<p data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1030\"><strong data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1028\">Fast nationwide shipping<\/strong><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1032\" data-end=\"1186\">You can choose from <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1088\">cardboard candle boxes with lids<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"1090\" data-end=\"1109\">window cut-outs<\/strong>, or <strong data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1136\">custom-fit sleeves<\/strong> \u2014 all sized precisely to your product dimensions.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1188\" data-end=\"1236\">Ideal for Handmade and Bulk Candle Packaging<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1531\">Whether you sell <strong data-start=\"1255\" data-end=\"1282\">hand-poured soy candles<\/strong> or <strong data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1310\">high-end jar candles<\/strong>, we help you match the packaging to the purpose. Our cardboard boxes for candles are available in custom sizes to fit single items or larger sets. You can also request inserts or dividers to hold multiple items in place.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1748\">From basic kraft to rigid white cardboard, our options support both presentation and durability. These boxes are often used for retail packaging, ecommerce, gifting, or safe delivery at craft fairs and online sales.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1868\">We also offer finishes that resist oil, moisture, or wax stains \u2014 especially helpful for scented or oil-based candles.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"1870\" data-end=\"1873\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1912\">Planning Seasonal Gift Packaging?<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1914\" data-end=\"2287\">If you&#8217;re preparing for holidays or retail displays, you may want to coordinate your candle boxes with related seasonal packaging. Our <strong data-start=\"2049\" data-end=\"2141\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-ornament-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2139\">Cardboard Ornament Boxes<\/a><\/strong> are a great match for festive collections or candle gift bundles. You can get them in similar materials and custom prints to match your branding.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"2289\" data-end=\"2292\" \/>\n<h3 data-start=\"2294\" data-end=\"2340\">Key Benefits of Our Cardboard Candle Boxes<\/h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2622\">\n<li data-start=\"2342\" data-end=\"2379\">\n<p data-start=\"2344\" data-end=\"2379\">Custom sizes and shapes available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2380\" data-end=\"2434\">\n<p data-start=\"2382\" data-end=\"2434\">Coating options: Gloss, Matte, Soft Touch, Spot UV<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2435\" data-end=\"2479\">\n<p data-start=\"2437\" data-end=\"2479\">Die-cut window or sleeve-style available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2480\" data-end=\"2535\">\n<p data-start=\"2482\" data-end=\"2535\">Food-safe and eco-certified paperboard upon request<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2579\">\n<p data-start=\"2538\" data-end=\"2579\">Fast turnaround and free design support<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2580\" data-end=\"2622\">\n<p data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2622\">No setup fees, low MOQs for small brands<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"2624\" data-end=\"2733\">Our boxes help small businesses ship professionally and affordably \u2014 without compromising brand presentation.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Cardboard Candle Boxes Wholesale Sizing and Use Cases<\/h2>\n<h4>Popular Box Sizes for Candle Packaging<\/h4>\n<p>We manufacture boxes in custom and standard dimensions. Some commonly ordered sizes are listed below:<\/p>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] 