order\">&#8211; Suitable for various candle types: glass jars, tins, travel candles<br \/>\n&#8211; Ideal for retail, gifting, and bulk packaging<br \/>\n&#8211; Customizable for branding and protection<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Durable and protective materials<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">High-quality finishing for shelf appeal<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Protective inserts to prevent damage<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Boutique stores, Online sales, Corporate gifts<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h4>Applications of Cardboard Candle Packaging<\/h4>\n<p>You can use our <strong>cardboard candle packaging<\/strong> for:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Scented candle kits<\/li>\n<li>Luxury gift boxes<\/li>\n<li>Monthly candle subscriptions<\/li>\n<li>Retail and wholesale shelf stock<\/li>\n<li>Promotional giveaway sets<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>All boxes can be printed inside and outside, or left blank if you prefer <strong>cardboard candle boxes empty<\/strong> for labeling later.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Printing, Material, and Finishing Options<\/h2>\n<h4>Full-Service Custom Packaging for Candle Brands<\/h4>\n<p>We offer premium printing and coating options to help you build a consistent brand image.<\/p>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Description<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Printing<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">High-quality printing with full CMYK or Pantone Matching System (PMS) for precise color matching. Supports single or double-sided printing.<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Kraft Paper (natural brown), Recycled Board (eco-friendly), SBS (Solid Bleached Sulfate &#8211; smooth white surface), White Cardboard<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">UV Coating (protective glossy layer), Matte Lamination (soft touch, non-reflective), Gloss Lamination (shiny finish), Soft Touch Coating<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">QR Codes for interactive marketing, Custom Logos, Barcodes for retail scanning, Variable Data Printing for personalization<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Candle packaging boxes wholesale, Gift packaging, Retail display boxes<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Design Setup<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Provided with all qualifying orders<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">SBS (premium white), Recycled Paper (eco-conscious), Kraft Paper<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Embossing (raised design), Debossing (indented design), Foil Stamping (metallic finish in gold, silver, or custom colors)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">3D Mockups for visualizing design, Live Proofing via digital platforms, Custom dielines\/templates for unique box shapes<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Online candle stores, Boutique packaging, Seasonal promotional packaging<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transparent border-0 p-0 m-0 [td_&amp;]:table-cell align-baseline inline-block align-top\" type=\"button\" data-state=\"closed\">Branding<\/button><\/strong><\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Full branding options including inside and outside printing to enhance brand visibility. Supports spot UV and metallic foils for premium look.<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Kraft Paper, White Cardboard, Recycled Board<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Spot UV Coating (selective gloss on matte background), Gold\/Silver Foil Stamping, Holographic Foil, Soft Touch Lamination<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Custom templates tailored to brand identity, Seasonal or limited edition branding, Interactive elements like scratch-offs or peel stickers<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Seasonal launches, Brand promotions, Limited edition collections<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<h4>We Also Support Bulk and Luxury Orders<\/h4>\n<p>If you\u2019re planning a large batch, we provide <strong>cardboard candle boxes bulk<\/strong> pricing. For premium candle products, ask about our <strong>luxury candle boxes wholesale<\/strong> options with rigid board and magnetic closures.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Bulk Orders with Free Shipping and Fast Service<\/h2>\n<h4>Order Quantities and Delivery Timelines<\/h4>\n<p>Whether you need 100 units or over 50,000, we\u2019ve got scalable manufacturing and fulfillment ready.<\/p>\n<table class=\"border-borderMain dark:border-borderMainDark my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset dark:bg-offsetDark\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Feature<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Details<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Options<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Choices<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Add-ons &amp; Features<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Usage\/Application<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\"><strong><button class=\"hover:duration-80 duration-800 cursor-pointer text-left align-baseline inline underline decoration-textOff\/25 decoration-1 underline-offset-[5px] animate-underlineFade after:content-[&quot;&quot;] hover:text-super hover:decoration-super\/80 hover:underline-offset-[7px] dark:decoration-textOffDark\/30 dark:hover:decoration-super\/80 transition-all motion-reduce:transition-none appearance-none bg-transpa