\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>You can also request plain samples or full-color mockups before mass production.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Explore More Options with Cardboard Boxes for Specific Uses<\/h2>\n<h4>Custom Packaging by Product Category<\/h4>\n<p>Besides candle boxes, we also offer packaging for cosmetics, bakery, apparel, and subscription kits. Visit our category for <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cardboard-boxes-for-specific-uses\/\">Cardboard Boxes for Specific Uses<\/a><\/strong> to see product-specific packaging styles that suit your business.<\/p>\n<p>Each box style is fully customizable and made from recyclable or eco-preferred materials.<\/p>\n<hr \/>\n<h2>Place Your Order for Cardboard Candle Boxes Today<\/h2>\n<h4>How to Get Started in Minutes<\/h4>\n<p>Ordering custom packaging is simple:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Choose your box size and material<\/li>\n<li>Send your artwork or request help<\/li>\n<li>Approve a digital or 3D proof<\/li>\n<li>Confirm order and receive tracking<\/li>\n<li>Enjoy free shipping and fast delivery<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h4>Why Brands Choose Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Competitive rates on <strong>candle packaging boxes wholesale<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Custom options for <strong>large cardboard candle boxes<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Free services (design, shipping, die-line setup)<\/li>\n<li>High-quality board with accurate cutting<\/li>\n<li>Available with or without lids, windows, or inserts<\/li>\n<li>Packaging suitable for retail and subscription use<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Get in touch today to request a quote or upload your design. We\u2019ll help you build packaging that protects your candles and promotes your brand.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We offer wholesale prices and custom options to fit your needs. Choose from gloss, matte, or spot UV coatings to add a finishing touch. Our free design service and fast turnaround times make it easy to get your candles looking their be